Package: nitrateApp
Title: Explore Nitrate Concentrations for three NEON sites (June 2019 - July 2019)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Malaika", "Fernandes", role = c("aut", "cre"),
              email = "mfer0073@student.monash.edu"))
Description: Tools and a Shiny app to explore daily nitrate concentrations
    for three NEON river sites between June and July 2019. Includes access to
    a cleaned example dataset and simple visualisations for temporal and
    site-based patterns.
